# Repeated terrain symbols

Render terrain-specific symbols on every applied terrain hex while retaining the matching symbols in the radial selector.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Brick, Ore, Wheat, Lumber, Wool, Desert, and Ocean each use an appropriate distinct symbol.
- [ ] Several copies of the terrain symbol are distributed across each hex.
- [ ] Symbols render at approximately 50% opacity behind number tokens.
- [ ] Numbers, pips, pieces, placement targets, and radial controls remain legible above the symbols.
- [ ] Rendering remains stable while zooming, panning, and editing terrain.
- [ ] Focused rendering checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.

## Verification

- Add view/rendering coverage for terrain-to-symbol mapping and manually check representative numbered and unnumbered hexes.
